# Docker build-context hygiene for the production image.
#
# Goals:
#   1. Never send secrets or local state to the Docker daemon.
#   2. Keep host-built artifacts out (node_modules, dist): they are rebuilt in the image.
#   3. Keep the context small: tests, docs and OpenAPI tooling are not needed to build or
#      run the service.
# The Dockerfile COPYs explicit paths only, so this file is defence in depth.
# NOTE: a pattern without a leading "**/" matches at the context root only.

# --- VCS / editor / OS noise -------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.swp

# --- Dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the image) ----------------
**/node_modules
dist
coverage
.nyc_output
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Secrets and local environment: must never reach the image ---------------
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
secrets

# --- Local runtime data (e.g. evidence uploads) ------------------------------
.data

# --- Logs --------------------------------------------------------------------
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*

# --- Not needed to build or run the service ----------------------------------
tests
docs
scripts
*.md

# --- Container tooling (not part of the runtime filesystem) ------------------
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
compose*.yml
